    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Another way to dene learning from model evaluations is through surrogate models</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Another way to dene learning from model evaluations is through surrogate models [129]. In particular, Surrogate models get trained on</hasEvidenceText>
