    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">a surrogate-based optimization algorithm for hyperparameter tuning</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">uses the surrogate model to predict one vector of hyperparameters for each problem</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A surrogate model M provides a probabilistic interpretation of f whereby possible explanations for the function are seen as draws f k p ( f |D )</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Learning configuration that prone to have good performance according to the surrogate model</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
