    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An alternative direction for architecture search is evolutionary algorithms (EAs). They are well suited for this problem because they are black-box optimization algorithms that can optimize arbitrary structure.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">We tackle this issue by using a basic Evolutionary Algorithm, rather than Bayesian Optimization, to nd suitable hyperparameters.</hasEvidenceText>
