    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">constrained optimization problem</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">we consider the following constrained optimization problem</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">simultaneous optimization of multiple expensive-to-evaluate black-box functions under the presence of several constraints.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">These techniques have commonly formulated the problem as an optimization problem</hasEvidenceText>
