    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">define a set of qualitative criteria, spanning across six categories (Estimates, Scope, Productivity, Interpretability, Customizability, and Connectivity)</hasEvidenceText>
