    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">a meta-learning approach where the meta-features of the input dataset is extracted and compared with the meta-features of the datasets that are stored in the frameworks knowledge base</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
