    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">One of the most important ones is interpretability of results. Users are rarely satisfied with just a predictive model; they also seek to understand the patterns in their data. Thus, results should not be a black-box</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
