    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">an efcient post-processing method (which can be run in a second process on-the-y) to construct an ensemble out of them. This automatic ensemble construction avoids to commit itself to a single hyperparameter setting</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
